# anthropic_service_account_workspaces (Data Source)

Lists the workspace memberships (implicit and explicit) of a Workload Identity Federation service account. All pages are fetched automatically. Every service account has an implicit membership in the organization's default workspace even when it holds no explicit membership anywhere; that entry is returned as the first page's first result.

> **API**: `GET /v1/organizations/service_accounts/{service_account_id}/workspaces`.
> **Auth**: requires an org:admin OAuth bearer token (`auth_token` / `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`), from `ant auth login --scope org:admin` or a workload identity federation rule. Admin API keys (`admin_api_key` / `ANTHROPIC_ADMIN_API_KEY`) are **not** accepted on this endpoint.
> **Beta header**: none required.
> **Cost**: Free.

